\p{These are the accompanying mathematical notes for the research project
FNIP. FNIP is read “F-nip”, for neuron interaction process, the neuron,
its synapses and the brain studied as dynamical processes in which a brief
interaction can tip the system into a new state. It is also a coined acronym
for “Formulating Neuron Interaction Process”.}

